{"4484260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Trash City Turbo", "steam_appid": 4484260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Fire up your <strong>Turbo-charged Street Sweeper</strong> and carve perfect lines, at breakneck speeds, through the filth-ridden lower sectors of Neotropolis.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trash City Turbo is about cleaning each filthy little district of Neotropolis, as fast as you can. It’s immediate fun and satisfaction with minimal friction, all wrapped in a gorgeous <strong>Cyber-Chunk</strong> art style. Explore the single-player campaign as you fight to protect your honest living from a ruthless mega corp intent on pushing their automated, robotic tech into all sectors of municipal work. Revisit locations and challenges to score the perfect run on each job.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Appeal</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Pick up and play’ bursts of high speed gameplay with immediate appeal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A satisfying cleaning system that tickles your primordial, lizard brain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique, stylized handling model, begging to be mastered</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old-school videogame design - no micro-transactions, time-wasting or bloated unlock systems</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Fire up your <strong>Turbo-charged Street Sweeper</strong> and carve perfect lines, at breakneck speeds, through the filth-ridden lower sectors of Neotropolis.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trash City Turbo is about cleaning each filthy little district of Neotropolis, as fast as you can. It’s immediate fun and satisfaction with minimal friction, all wrapped in a gorgeous <strong>Cyber-Chunk</strong> a